      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "要怎么才能让这样的她好好休息一下呢？\n思考的时候，桌上随意放着的\n特雷森岛传单映入了眼帘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2bab2aa1eab0de4357c8b2858a8c6656eb5322ec0358044fd096c55b83bc0544",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
